<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For reference, SWE-Bench Verified leaderboard top reported domain-specific agent achieves 0.79<span id="footnote8" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">8</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">8</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">8</span>
              
              
              
              
              
              
              
            <a href="https://www.swebench.com/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:83%;">SWE-Bench Verified</a></span></span></span>,
BrowseComp+ and AppWorld are 0.80<span id="footnote9" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">9</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">9</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">9</span>
              
              
              
              
              
              
              
            <a href="https://huggingface.co/spaces/Tevatron/BrowseComp-Plus" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:83%;">BrowseComp+</a></span></span></span>, and <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.73" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.73</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.73</annotation></semantics></math><span id="footnote10" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">10</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">10</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">10</span>
              
              
              
              
              
              
              
            <a href="https://appworld.dev/leaderboard" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:83%;">AppWorld</a></span></span></span>, respectively. <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>-Bench Airline (<math id="A4.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.73" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.73</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.73</annotation></semantics></math>), Retail (<math id="A4.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.86" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.86</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.86</annotation></semantics></math>), and Telecom (<math id="A4.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.98" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.98</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.98</annotation></semantics></math>)<span id="footnote11" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">11</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">11</sup>
